brief:
A social card for the launch of Orbit 2.0, 1200×630 px, as a PNG.

- Background: assets/orbit-card-bg.png (a 1200×630 file) fills the whole card.
- Fonts: Inter (regular and bold), in fonts/.
- Centered, stacked 24px apart, and the group centered vertically in the card:
  - the Orbit logo, assets/orbit-logo-white.png (a 252×128 file), shown 126px wide;
  - "Ship every surface from one codebase": Inter bold, 72px, #ffffff, centered, at most 2 lines;
  - "Live previews, typed templates and one-click deploys.": Inter regular, 30px, #c7d2fe, centered;
  - a pill "orbit.dev/2": Inter bold, 28px, #ffffff on #6d5efc, fully rounded, 14px × 28px padding.
